; AK-47 table — Counter-Strike 1.6 reference values.
; Scalars: https://csjs.live/weapons/ak-47 (36 dmg, 77.5% armor, 628 RPM /
; 0.0955 s cycle, 98% per 500 u, 2 penetration stages, 30+90 ammo, 221 u/s),
; cross-checked with https://counterstrike.fandom.com/wiki/AK-47 (35->36 dmg note).
; Code constants: https://github.com/s1lentq/ReGameDLL_CS
; - regamedll/dlls/weapons.h: AK47_DAMAGE 36, AK47_RANGE_MODIFER 0.98,
;   AK47_MAX_SPEED 221, AK47_RELOAD_TIME 2.45, AK47_ACCURACY_DIVISOR 200.
; - regamedll/dlls/wpn_shared/wpn_ak47.cpp PrimaryAttack: air 0.04+0.4*acc,
;   move(>140u/s) 0.04+0.07*acc, grounded 0.0275*acc (no duck branch);
;   cycle 0.0955 s; FireBullets3 penetration 2, BULLET_PLAYER_762MM.
;   First-shot spreads below use fresh accuracy 0.2, converted to degrees
;   via atan(spread): stand/duck 0.0055 -> 0.3151, move 0.054 -> 3.091,
;   air 0.12 -> 6.8428.
; - regamedll/dlls/weapontype.h: AK47_MAX_CLIP 30, MAX_AMMO_762NATO 90.
; - regamedll/dlls/player.cpp TraceAttack: HITGROUP_HEAD damage x4;
;   TakeDamage: ARMOR_RATIO 0.5 x 1.55 (WEAPON_AK47) = 0.775.
; - regamedll/dlls/cbase.cpp FireBullets3: falloff pow(rangeMod, dist/500);
;   wall damage x0.6 (CHAR_TEX_WOOD flDamageModifier), penetration skip
;   39 u/stage (BULLET_PLAYER_762MM).
; RecoilTable: 1.6 has NO deterministic table (punchangle + KickBack). This
; 30-entry cumulative (pitch-up+, yaw-right+) table is authored for FrutaCS
; from the documented community-consensus AK spray shape: climb up 1-6,
; swing left 7-10, long swing right 11-19, settle 20-30. COMMUNITY CONSENSUS.
; MaxWallThicknessU 64: consensus simplification (thin ~40 u cover falls to
; rifles, structural ~120 u walls stop everything); engine order preserved.
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="WeaponData" load_steps=2 format=3]

